        <briefdescription>
<para>Create a <computeroutput>RpcPhase1Fn</computeroutput> callable. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>node_addresses</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Map from node_id → &quot;host:port&quot;. Unknown node_ids vote ABORT. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>timeout</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>gRPC deadline applied to every PREPARE call. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>mtls</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Optional mTLS credential bundle. When present and all three PEM fields are non-empty, the channel is created with <computeroutput>grpc::SslCredentials</computeroutput>. Missing PEM material is rejected unless <computeroutput>allow_insecure</computeroutput> is explicitly set for a local test override. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Callable compatible with <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_distributed_transaction_manager_1a92aa1963812e16cd85ca4fd9279c3236" kindref="member">DistributedTransactionManager::RpcPhase1Fn</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
