    <briefdescription>
<para>Factory for a <computeroutput>RpcPhase1Fn</computeroutput> that sends Phase-1 PREPARE over gRPC. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="preprocessor">#ifdef<sp/>THEMIS_HAS_CORE_GRPC</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_distributed_transaction_manager_1ad65b328c8a05c251b128ac80558bf0a6" kindref="member">DistributedTransactionManager::setRpcPhase1Fn</ref>(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_grpc_rpc_phase1_adapter_1a2f716e6a8509f6f1847b1e2852d5a59b" kindref="member">GrpcRpcPhase1Adapter::make</ref>(node_addresses,<sp/>500<ref refid="test__wave4c__t1t4__hardening_8cpp_1ac3a080cca78ca980a69d1cb9b76615eb" kindref="member">ms</ref>));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="preprocessor">#endif</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>When <computeroutput>THEMIS_HAS_CORE_GRPC</computeroutput> is not defined, <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_grpc_rpc_phase1_adapter_1a2f716e6a8509f6f1847b1e2852d5a59b" kindref="member">make()</ref></computeroutput> returns a callable that always votes ABORT and logs a warning, so test/headless builds fail-closed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
